msgstr "Score de confiance d’abus"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1113
msgid ""
"Optional. If set (0–100), submissions at or above this AbuseIPDB score are "
"treated as spam on every form. If left blank, each form’s Spam Threshold "
